5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope we can choose an exhibition that is wonderful for our guests but also kind to our hardworking staff.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,A balanced approach is necessary. We should look at the data logically to avoid the usual pitfalls of over-ambition.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's not be too boring, though! I want something that actually makes people excited to visit, not just something that looks good in a brochure.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with a balanced approach. We must ensure the gallery can physically handle whatever we bring in this time.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to know where all the money goes! It always disappears like magic, and then we get scary bills. Let's find the leaks!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, you are always so spirited. Perhaps we should also consider if we have enough hands to help with the setup?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. Logistics are where we usually fail. I'm interested in why we keep apologizing to visitors for missing items.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, that's because we focus on the ""prestige"" of the loan rather than the experience. We need to know what people actually liked.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about the structural limits. We cannot ignore the physical strain on the main gallery's infrastructure.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm going to be a detective! I'll find out which parts of the budget are swallowing the money quietly.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into our people. It is important to know who is actually available to work these days.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on the delivery failures. I want to see the gap between the plan and the reality of shipping.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'm going for the truth. I want to see the numbers and the comments to see what actually draws a crowd.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the structural survey and the maintenance logs. We need to know the building's current state.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm picking the money stuff! I want to see the transport costs and those mount-making charges.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
