35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, it seems our conservation lab is quite overwhelmed. I worry we are asking too much of our few remaining staff.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,"As I suspected. The paperwork for international loans is a mess, and the transport costs are becoming an absurd drain on our resources.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Here is the real tea: people are bored of static displays. They want movement and human interaction, or they don't come back.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"We have a problem. The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and our powered displays are failing far too often.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,I found it! The transport and the fancy mounts are eating all our money! It's like a giant monster eating our budget!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, please don't be too upset. We just need to find a project that doesn't require a miracle to execute.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"If we choose a candidate with heavy international loans, we are essentially planning for a failure. It's logically unsound.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, if we choose something ""safe"" and static, we're just planning for a ghost town. Let's prioritize the visitor's heart!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, ""heart"" doesn't fix a collapsed floor. We cannot accept any proposal that exceeds the weight limit of the bay.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Why do we pay so much for mounts? If we pick something that doesn't need fancy stands, we can spend the money on something fun!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I am very concerned that we are planning as if we have a full team. We must be gentle with our staff.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,Then the solution is simple: minimize the number of external loans. Local content reduces both the cost and the risk of delivery failure.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"Local content is great, but only if it's alive! I want to see live demonstrations or something that breathes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"Live demonstrations are fine, but powered displays are a liability. The maintenance logs show they are too unstable for the main gallery.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I agree with @Shion! Let's pick the one that doesn't cost a million dollars just to move the stuff into the room!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
